[en.FOCUS_C02_LOYALTY]
“Absolute Loyalty”

[en.FOCUS_C02_LOYALTY_desc]
Equestria is a globe, if you want to go east, sometimes it is best to go west first. Of course, when you appear loyal, you can always be rewarded or ignored.

[en.FOCUS_C02_LOYALTY_TOOLTIP]
Win the support of the Cozy Glow through the “absolute loyalty” posture, and the support of the Empire will influence the public opinion, and the support will be improved.

[zh.FOCUS_C02_LOYALTY]
忠！诚！

[zh.FOCUS_C02_LOYALTY_desc]
小马利亚是个球体，如果你想要往东走，也许有时最好的选择是先往西走。当然，忠诚的姿态不可能得不到奖励或轻视。

[zh.FOCUS_C02_LOYALTY_TOOLTIP]
通过“绝对忠诚”的姿态赢得和煦光流的支持，帝国的支持将会影响舆论的评价，提高支持度。

